  "sourceTitle": "Peanut Butter Corn Flake Squares",
  "sourceText": "Peanut Butter Corn Flake Squares\nBy: Michelle La Clair\nPublished: Saturday, February 20, 2010 - 4:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Sugar\n1 cup Karo Syrup\n12 ounces jar Peanut Butter\n6 cups Corn Flakes\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Bring Sugar and Karo Syrup to a boil; add peanut butter; cook until melted. 2 Remove from heat. Add corn flakes and mix. 3 May spoon out into drops or put into buttered pan and cut into squares.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "1 cup Sugar"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 cup Karo Syrup"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "12 ounces jar Peanut Butter"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "6 cups Corn Flakes"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Bring Sugar and Karo Syrup to a boil; add peanut butter; cook until melted. 2 Remove from heat. Add corn flakes and mix. 3 May spoon out into drops or put into buttered pan and cut into squares."
      }
    ]
